 # egui_dock changelog
 
+## 0.8.0 - 2023-09-28
+
+### Breaking changes
+- Upgraded `egui` to version 0.23.
+- Updated MSRV to Rust 1.70.
+
+### Improvements
+- Revised documentation for `TabViewer`.
+
